---
import logoImage from '../assets/logo.png';
---

<section class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-4" style="color:#0C2F39;">
      Características principales
    </h2>
    <p class="text-center text-gray-600 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Todo lo que necesitas para dominar nuevas palabras de forma efectiva
    </p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Feature 1 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 hover:shadow-lg transition">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6" style="background:#155263;">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color:#0C2F39;">
          Diccionario personal
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">
          Crea tu propio diccionario con palabras que realmente necesitas aprender. Sin duplicados, todo organizado.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 hover:shadow-lg transition">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6" style="background:#1E758D;">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color:#0C2F39;">
          Ejercicios automáticos
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">
          La app genera ejercicios interactivos automáticamente a partir de tu vocabulario guardado.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 hover:shadow-lg transition">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6" style="background:#FFC93C;">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color:#0C2F39;">
          Retención a largo plazo
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">
          Aprende sin memorizar de forma dolorosa. El sistema refuerza tu vocabulario de manera natural con alta retención a largo plazo.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
